00:04:31.734 --> 00:04:34.334
-Ah! Tariq Trotter, everyone.

00:04:34.334 --> 00:04:35.567
Thank you. Nice going, Tariq.
I see what you mean.

00:04:35.567 --> 00:04:37.834
Yes, thank you.
♪♪

00:04:40.434 --> 00:04:42.567
